Third-party components
----------------------

None. Sundial has no third-party dependency and no CDN.

Vendored from this project's own kits (same licence, same author), copied verbatim on 26/11/2026:

- web-kit 0.1.0 — docs/play/web-kit.js — the offline shell, storage helpers and PWA registration
- export-kit 1.0.0 — docs/play/export-kit.js — Blob download, used for the day export

Neither kit is modified. Neither makes a network request.

Not real astronomy
------------------

The dial is an arc between two times you set — sunrise and sunset, defaulting to 06:00 and 18:00. It is not
a computed sunrise for your latitude, and the app does not claim to be an almanac. What it does claim, and
tests, is that a position and a time cannot disagree: both come from the same function.

One surface, one job
--------------------

No tags, reminders, search or sync. The spec forbids a second job and the engine has no shape for one.
